WEBVTT

00:02:57.292 --> 00:03:01.178
nambari moja kwa hisa za kimataifa

00:03:01.202 --> 00:03:03.135
ilikuwa ni British American Tobacco.

00:03:03.805 --> 00:03:06.225
Nambari mbili, Imperial Tobacco.

00:03:06.575 --> 00:03:08.566
Nambari nne, Philip Morris.

00:03:09.165 --> 00:03:11.886
Na nambari tano, Swedish Match Company.

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:14.609
Nne ya kampuni tano 
zilikuwa ni kampuni za tumbaku,

00:03:14.633 --> 00:03:16.886
uwekezaji wangu kama oncologist

00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:19.760
Na nikagundua kuwa si mimi pekee.

00:03:19.784 --> 00:03:21.672
Ilikuwa ni kila mwanachama wa huo mfuko.

00:03:22.125 --> 00:03:25.378
Na hapo nikagundua kuwa 
si malipo yangu

00:03:25.402 --> 00:03:28.086
ya uzeeni pekee, ni zote.
Na nikagundua kuwa

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:31.204
si uwekezaji wa malipo ya uzeeni,
ni mabenki, bima